# The knobs as on the FM-1 (their detents): from rest the first click only wakes a knob, so a detent that
# snaps on by itself changes nothing; a click straight back within a quarter second is the snap, not taken;
# turning, every click counts, and a fast turn goes further (two steps a click under 90 ms, four under 40 ms)
# on a knob that sets an amount. Choosing (SELECT's rows) is a step a click.
knobs real
autoplay 0
wait 300
expect macro1 64
turn K1 1
wait 800
expect macro1 64
turn K1 3 200
wait 800
expect macro1 68
turn K1 1 100
turn K1 -1 100
wait 800
expect macro1 68
turn K1 -1 1000
turn K1 -1 1000
wait 800
expect macro1 68
turn K1 5 200
wait 50
expect macro1 76
wait 800
turn K1 6 60
expect macro1 96
wait 800
turn K1 -6 20
expect macro1 56
wait 800
tap GLO
turn SELECT 6 30
expect row 5
